            <p class="card-text">Mr. Pradeep Bakshi is the Managing Director & CEO of Voltas Limited. Mr. Bakshi took over as Head of Operations of UPBG, twelve years ago, with an emphatic oath of turning around the brand to its current stature. He is one of the most versatile and multi-talented executives to reach the company’s top office, having close to three decades of experience in the consumer durable industry. 
<br/><br/>
